{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is Simulation with\u00a0limited information about chimera's stat and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Chimera</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In game, you have 6 base animals to be chimera. You can make them to chimera by inserting gene. Chimera has several genes. Efficiently inserted Genes are very helpful to chimera's survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Genes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In game, Genes are very important. They have stat coefficients and unique skill. Higher grades mean higher stat coefficients. And higher grade genes can be inserted more. In game, you can get 9 genes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Skill\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chimeras can use up to three additional skills. Some skills require conditions.\u00a0You should carefully choose the 3 different genes that are inserted initially, considering those conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. Test<br>Created chimeras require testing. A strong chimera is a surviving chimera. A defeated chimera is no longer usable. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select animal and insert gene to selected animal. after this process, you can get your chimera.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549720/extras/ScreenShot2.png?t=1744985262\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and test with Npc researchers.\u00a0after test, you receive limited test info to create more power chimera.\u00a0you should select between high status or skill efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549720/extras/ScreenShot3.png?t=1744985262\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/store